  "provenance": "Repo-local descriptor (the publisher's own repo). Backends and context come from the repo's litertlm_manifest.json. The packaged chat template closes the think block in the generation prompt, so the model answers without reasoning and no channel is declared; the vl_int8 variant adds the vision encoder (fp16) with the encoder kept on the CPU until a GPU run is verified. On the Pixel 8a (8 GB), at commit 4170d2bd on LiteRT-LM 0.16.1, the gpu profile killed the test process during Engine.initialize (lowmemorykiller, 5.1 GB rss + 2.9 GB swap: the bundle declares fp32 activations); cpu answered. The default profile is cpu.",
